        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    mean = 9\n    std_dev = 2\n    data_points = [5, 8, 13, 12, 7, 9, 10, 6, 11, 7]\n\n    # Calculate the percentage within one standard deviation (7% to 11%)\n    count_within_range = sum(\n        mean - std_dev <= value <= mean + std_dev\n        for value in data_points\n    )\n    answer = (count_within_range / len(data_points)) * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(answer, 2)\n```",
